flowchart TB
    Browser[Angular client] --> Endpoint{ASP.NET endpoint}
    Endpoint --> Service[CompaniesHouseSearchService]
    Service --> Upstream[Companies House API]
    Upstream --> Service

    Service --> RequestType{Request type}

    RequestType -->|Name or number search| SearchTx[Search transaction]
    SearchTx --> SearchLog[(search_logs)]
    SearchTx --> Current[(Companies)]
    SearchTx --> Links[(search_log_companies)]
    SearchTx -. no snapshots .-> History[(CompanyHistory)]

    RequestType -->|Company profile| ProfileTx[Profile transaction]
    ProfileTx --> SearchLog
    ProfileTx --> Hash{Content hash changed?}
    Hash -->|No| Seen[Update LastSeenAt]
    Seen --> Current
    Hash -->|Yes or first profile| Snapshot[Increment version and insert snapshot]
    Snapshot --> Current
    Snapshot --> History
    ProfileTx --> Links

    RequestType -->|History read| History
    History --> Endpoint
    Current --> Endpoint
    Endpoint --> Browser

    Startup[Schema initialization] --> Migration[(SchemaMigrations)]
    Migration --> Backfill[Backfill existing companies as version 1]
    Backfill --> Current
    Backfill --> History

